            "detailed_description": "Tetrageddon is a collection of games, strange rabbit holes, tangents, and a comedic digital nightmare about the internet of old.<br />\r\nIt is a bizarre relic from the era of online Flash games, and pretty much delivers on as random of an experience as you would expect.<br />\r\nEach game is wildly different in terms of genre and gameplay. They all have their own silly tangents and Easter eggs to explore. You can spend hours getting lost.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore haunted desktops and abandoned spaces as you delve deeper into a pixelated fever dream. On your journey you will encounter silly characters and other oddities while you brave what feels like someone’s long forgotten games folder on a computer found during a garage sale.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTetrageddon is a satire about our digital culture in the form of a strange collection of mini games. If you like random humor, warioware, miss the days of Flash game portals and the weird trappings of 90's nostalgia... then Tetrageddon is for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are a total of ten mini-games that you can uncover. These range from Anatomically Incorrect Dinosaurs, a dinosaur assembly simulator... to Froggy (It's Hungry!), a post-apocalyptic game about a frog surviving on an international mega-highway at the end of the world.<br />\r\nTetrageddon is the type of game that's hard to describe and best experienced for yourself.",
            "about_the_game": "Tetrageddon is a collection of games, strange rabbit holes, tangents, and a comedic digital nightmare about the internet of old.<br />\r\nIt is a bizarre relic from the era of online Flash games, and pretty much delivers on as random of an experience as you would expect.<br />\r\nEach game is wildly different in terms of genre and gameplay. They all have their own silly tangents and Easter eggs to explore. You can spend hours getting lost.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore haunted desktops and abandoned spaces as you delve deeper into a pixelated fever dream. On your journey you will encounter silly characters and other oddities while you brave what feels like someone’s long forgotten games folder on a computer found during a garage sale.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTetrageddon is a satire about our digital culture in the form of a strange collection of mini games. If you like random humor, warioware, miss the days of Flash game portals and the weird trappings of 90's nostalgia... then Tetrageddon is for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are a total of ten mini-games that you can uncover. These range from Anatomically Incorrect Dinosaurs, a dinosaur assembly simulator... to Froggy (It's Hungry!), a post-apocalyptic game about a frog surviving on an international mega-highway at the end of the world.<br />\r\nTetrageddon is the type of game that's hard to describe and best experienced for yourself.",
            "short_description": "Tetrageddon is what the internet does to people. Bring the internet to your desktop with stunning 8-bit graphics, monkeys, and a mild lack of self respect that games can be proud of today.",
